<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Flag Emerald - 105,000 tonnes coal Hampton Roads/Taranto $5.90 30,000shinc/30,000 shinc 20-29/4 Coe andf Clerici.</p>
<p>ORE - Veni - 160,000 tonnes ore Narvik option Tubarao/Rotterdam $2.70/$5.50 fio six days shinc 5-20/5 Rohstoffhandel.</p>
<p>Amber - 140,000 tonnes ore Sepetiba/Ijmuiden approx. $6.25 fio 6.5 days shinc 1-7/5 Hoogovens.</p>
</text>
